  "body": "Recently we found some of the service worker wpt tests failing to fire onload for 404 responses.  It turned out these responses were being served as \"text/json\" which gecko does not understand.  Apparently \"text/json\" is reasonably common on the web, though, as both jquery and blink understand it.\n\nPlease consider spec'ing text/json as another text type.\n\nThe related gecko bug is:\n\n  https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1201632\n",
